{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50187","headline":"城旁□□[一]伯二五六七下同 · 王昌龄","name":"城旁□□[一]伯二五六七下同","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"降奚能骑射，战马百余匹，甲仗明寒川，霜□□□□。\n□□煞单于，薄暮红旗出。\n城旁粗少年，骤马垂长鞭，脱却□□□，□剑沦秋天。\n（项云「沦」疑当作「轮」，同抡。\n）匈奴不敢出，漠北开（闭）[三]甲烟。\n（[一]标题残去二三字。\n按《全唐诗》昌龄有《城旁曲》，但内容与此全异。\n[二]余疑「开」爲「闭」误，俞云：「烟尘四合则虏起，今匈奴不出，故开霁也。\n依平仄论亦宜平声字，「开」字不误。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}